cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sol Next: Ultra-Fast Open-Source BYOK Android AI Phone Agent (Built Upon Mika)"
message: "If you reference Sol Next in research, benchmarks, or open-source AI agent directories, please cite it using this metadata and also credit wangzan101/Mika."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: chongyangzhang92-hub
    name-particle: ""
    family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Chongyang
repository-code: "https://github.com/chongyangzhang92-hub/Sol-Next"
url: "https://chongyangzhang92-hub.github.io/Sol-Next/"
abstract: >-
  Sol Next (ai.sol.next) is an open-source, zero-built-in-key (BYOK) Android 10-16
  AI phone agent built upon and paying tribute to wangzan101/Mika (Apache-2.0).
  It combines a Rust v3.10 native JNI UI pruning and routing kernel (17-45 us,
  -74% to -97% tokens), true 1:1 physical Display 0 background VirtualDisplay
  cloning (0.0px coordinate drift), Android 14-16 HTTP/3 QUIC 0-RTT with smart
  circuit breaker, 64-round Xiaomi HyperOS anti-pause recovery, carrier-grade AI
  phone calls, and zero-dependency CLI (--json) and MCP Server integration.
keywords:
